OL,3,ASouth Sudan's president dissolves
OL,4,Agovernment ahead of country's first
OL,5,Aelections
OL,6,
OL,7,FSouth Sudan President Salva Kiir has
OL,8,Fdissolved the transitional government,
OL,9,Fthree months before the country's first
OL,10,Felection since its independence in
OL,11,F2011.
OL,13,FThe country has previously postponed
OL,14,Felections twice and extended the
OL,15,Ftransitional period several times.
OL,17,FUnder the amended law, signed on
OL,18,FMonday, Kiir removed the country's five
OL,19,Fvice-presidents and dissolved
OL,20,Fparliament, as well as national and
OL,21,Fstate governments.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
