OL,3,ASouth Sudan's president dissolves
OL,4,Agovernment ahead of country's first
OL,5,Aelections
OL,6,
OL,7,FKiir is the presidential candidate of
OL,8,Fhis Sudan People's Liberation Movement
OL,9,F(SPLM). No prominent figures have
OL,10,Fannounced plans to challenge him in the
OL,11,FDecember poll. The main opposition
OL,12,Fleader Riek Machar was sacked as
OL,13,Fvice-president last year and charged
OL,14,Fwith treason.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
